---
title: Atelier
seoTitle: Boutique Landscape Atelier
seoDescription: Atelier Wehrle designs high-end private gardens through concept, planting strategy and execution management across Germany, Switzerland and Europe.
metaImage: Manuel-Wehrle-Gartendesigner-Gartengestaltung.jpg
introCopy: |-
  “We use the power of garden design to challenge conventions, reveal clarity and open the mind.” Atelier Wehrle is an internationally active boutique landscape atelier based in Potsdam and Ascona.

  Our work reconnects people with nature and treats gardens as an essential part of everyday life. We design spaces where the seasons remain visible and tangible over time. For Manuel Wehrle and his team, an authentic relationship with nature defines true luxury.

  House and garden always reflect personality. Through precise concept design, planting strategy, high-quality materials and excellent craftsmanship, we create bespoke outdoor spaces shaped by context, history and long-term use.
awards:
  - image: Gaerten-des-Jahres-Atelier-Wehrle.png
    alt: Gaerten des Jahres award for Atelier Wehrle
    link: https://gaerten-des-jahres.com/planer/atelier-wehrle
  - image: Manuel-Wehrle-Auszeichnung-chelsea-flower-show-medal.jpg
    alt: Manuel Wehrle receiving an award at the Chelsea Flower Show
    link: ''
  - image: /assets/img/03_Siegel_GdJ_2027_RGB_Basic_nominiert_500px.png
    alt: Gaerten des Jahres award for Atelier Wehrle
    link: ''
---

<section class="opener lax">

  <div class="wrapper">

    {% picture  "Gartengestaltung-Schloss-Leopoldskron-Salzburg.jpg", "Historic garden at Leopoldskron Castle in Salzburg" %}

  </div><!-- .wrapper -->

</section><!-- .opener -->


<section class="about">

  <div class="wrapper grd__a">

    <div class="item__1 oov">
      <h1 class="h5">Atelier Wehrle</h1>
      <div class="atelier-copy">
        {{ introCopy | markdown | safe }}
      </div>

    </div><!-- .item__1 -->

    <div class="item__2 oov">

       {% picture  "Gartenplanung-Gewaechshaus-im-Gemuesegarten.jpg", "Greenhouse in a structured kitchen garden" %}

    </div><!-- .item__2 -->

  </div><!-- .wrapper -->

  <section class="awards">
    <div class="wrapper">
      <h1 class="h6 oov">{{ translate[locale].award }}</h1>
      {% set awardsList = (awards or []) | reverse %}
      <ol class="award_list">
        {% for award in awardsList %}
        <li class="item__{{ loop.index }} oov">
          {% if award.link %}
          <a href="{{ award.link }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            {% picture award.image, award.alt %}
          </a>
          {% else %}
            {% picture award.image, award.alt %}
          {% endif %}
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  {% set teamMembers = collections.team_de if locale == "de" else collections.team_en %}

  <div class="wrapper team-list">
    {% for member in teamMembers %}
    <article class="team-member{% if loop.index is even %} team-member--reverse{% endif %}">
      <div class="team-member__image oov">
        {% if member.data.image %}
          {% picture member.data.image, member.data.alt %}
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      <div class="team-member__content oov">
        <h3 class="h5">{{ member.data.name }}</h3>
        {% if member.data.role %}
        <p class="role">{{ member.data.role }}</p>
        {% endif %}
        {{ member.templateContent | safe }}
      </div>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

</section><!-- .about -->

